---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { REPO, quests } from "../lib/data";
import { SITE } from "../config";
const unknown = quests.filter((q) => q.verdict === "unknown").length;
---
<Base title="Contribute" description="Help make WoW Forever leveling routes and data better: report a bad step, fix data, or improve the code.">
  <h1>Help make the site better</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    The site builds itself from the game client and open databases, and refreshes on its own. Times are estimates built from Classic rules,
    and {unknown} quests have no usable location yet. People who play are how the mistakes get found.
  </p>

  <h2>Ways to help</h2>
  <div class="ways">
    <section>
      <h3>Report a bad step</h3>
      <p>Wrong NPC, quest not available in Forever, a step that wastes time? Tell us which guide and step.</p>
      <p><a href={`${REPO}/issues/new?template=bug.yml`}>Report a problem</a></p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Tell us on Discord</h3>
      <p>Wrong coordinates, a missing quest or an item with the wrong source: post it in the quest-data or site-feedback channel.</p>
      <p><a href={SITE.discord} rel="noopener">Join the Discord</a></p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Write code or routes</h3>
      <p>Routes are short YAML files. The route generator, the data builders and this site are all in one repository.</p>
      <p><a href={`${REPO}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`}>Read the contributing guide</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .ways { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem 2rem; }
  .ways section { border-top: 2px solid var(--line); padding-top: 0.6rem; }
  .ways h3 { margin-top: 0; font-size: var(--step-1); }
</style>
